main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ nested decltype\(auto\) pack call yields 3: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG must FAIL: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
